      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEER CHEER (1) showed good early speed last start and led throughout to win for the first time by 4 lengths at Sale over 435m (24.82). Drawn well off an inside draw. Has placed five times at this trip. Can make it two on the bounce. LAKEVIEW RUBBLE (7) has a strong record this journey here with two wins and a minor from six starts. Hit the frame latest (23.21) when third at this track in a T3 RSTW. Looks well placed here and among the chances. GOTHAM THANOS (2) was game in defeat at the latest run, finishing third and beaten 2 lengths (23.25) behind Ancona at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Expecting another good run. BOUNCING BRODIE (4) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
